---
/**
 * About Section 01 visual foundation.
 * Natural scroll only. Motion must explain the thinking.
 */
---

<section id="problem-finding-story" class="problem-story section border-t border-line">
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="problem-intro reveal">
      <p class="eyebrow">01</p>
      <h2 class="mt-4 text-h2 font-semibold tracking-tight">How do you find the real problem?</h2>
      <div class="prose-hera mt-6 max-w-[50rem]">
        <p>
          I usually start by asking one thing:
          <strong>what is the user carrying that the product should be carrying instead?</strong>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-story-grid">
      <div class="problem-copy-rail">
        <article class="problem-step" data-problem-step="0">
          <p class="problem-step-label">The HERA story</p>
          <h3>I thought the problem was managing agents.</h3>
          <p class="problem-step-lead">It turned out the problem was everything I had to remember for them.</p>
          <p>
            AI could already ask questions, use tools, and work for long periods.
            I was still carrying the workflow in my own head.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="problem-step" data-problem-step="1">
          <p class="problem-step-label">What I questioned</p>
          <h3>Why should an intelligent product keep asking me to act as its memory?</h3>
          <p>
            If I already told a friend I went to Ibiza, I expect the next useful question
            to be “who did you go with?”, not “where did you travel?”
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="problem-step" data-problem-step="2">
          <p class="problem-step-label">What I realized</p>
          <h3>The bottleneck was not simply model intelligence. It was trust.</h3>
          <p>If the AI interrupts me, I need to trust that it checked what I already gave it first.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="problem-step" data-problem-step="3">
          <p class="problem-step-label">The product decision</p>
          <h3>Make context part of the product, not something hidden inside a prompt.</h3>
          <p>
            The person should provide meaning and judgment. The product should carry the context,
            state, history, work, and evidence around it.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>

      <div class="problem-visual-rail" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="problem-stage" data-problem-stage data-state="0">
          <div class="stage-chrome">
            <span class="stage-kicker">Following the burden</span>
            <span class="stage-progress">
              <i data-progress-dot="0"></i><i data-progress-dot="1"></i>
              <i data-progress-dot="2"></i><i data-progress-dot="3"></i>
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="scene scene-burden" data-scene="0">
            <div class="scene-title">
              <small>What the workflow felt like</small>
              <strong>The AI was working.<br />I was remembering everything.</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="burden-world">
              <div class="actor actor-human">
                <span class="actor-dot"></span>
                <strong>ME</strong>
                <small>trying to keep the work coherent</small>
              </div>

              <div class="actor actor-ai">
                <span class="actor-spark">✦</span>
                <strong>AI</strong>
                <small>working</small>
              </div>

              <span class="burden-chip burden-file">CURRENT FILE</span>
              <span class="burden-chip burden-decision">DECISION</span>
              <span class="burden-chip burden-agent">WHAT AGENT A LEARNED</span>
              <span class="burden-chip burden-version">REVIEWED VERSION</span>
              <span class="burden-chip burden-answer">DID I ANSWER THIS?</span>

              <div class="burden-count">
                <span>5</span><small>things I still had to carry</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="scene scene-ibiza" data-scene="1">
            <div class="scene-title">
              <small>A simple trust test</small>
              <strong>If the answer already exists,<br />why are you asking me again?</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="conversation-scene">
              <div class="time-label time-earlier">EARLIER</div>
              <div class="chat-bubble chat-user">
                <span>YOU</span><p>I just got back from Ibiza.</p>
              </div>

              <div class="memory-card">
                <div><small>TRIP</small><strong>Ibiza</strong></div>
                <span class="memory-check">✓</span>
              </div>

              <div class="time-label time-later">LATER</div>
              <div class="chat-bubble chat-ai chat-wrong">
                <span>AI</span><p>Where did you travel?</p><em>already known</em>
              </div>

              <div class="chat-bubble chat-ai chat-right">
                <span>AI</span><p>Who did you travel with?</p><em>not found → ask</em>
              </div>

              <svg class="memory-link" viewBox="0 0 460 250" preserveAspectRatio="none">
                <path class="memory-link-path" d="M 222 93 C 320 92, 320 158, 350 165" />
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="scene scene-trust" data-scene="2">
            <div class="scene-title">
              <small>The real bottleneck</small>
              <strong>An interruption should earn<br />the right to interrupt me.</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="trust-pipeline">
              <div class="incoming-question"><span>?</span><strong>Need an answer</strong></div>
              <div class="pipeline-line pipeline-line-a"></div>

              <div class="context-checks">
                <div class="context-source source-1"><span>DECISIONS</span><i>✓</i></div>
                <div class="context-source source-2"><span>FILES</span><i>✓</i></div>
                <div class="context-source source-3"><span>PREVIOUS WORK</span><i>✓</i></div>
                <div class="context-source source-4"><span>CONVERSATION</span><i>✓</i></div>
                <div class="context-source source-5"><span>ACCEPTED RESULT</span><i>✓</i></div>
              </div>

              <div class="pipeline-line pipeline-line-b"></div>

              <div class="resolution-gate">
                <small>CAN THE SYSTEM RESOLVE THIS?</small>
                <div class="resolution-paths">
                  <div class="resolution-system"><span>YES</span><strong>continue working</strong></div>
                  <div class="resolution-human"><span>NO</span><strong>human meaning required</strong></div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="human-required">
                <span class="actor-dot"></span>
                <strong>YOU</strong>
                <small>only when the answer is genuinely yours</small>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="scene scene-transfer" data-scene="3">
            <div class="scene-title">
              <small>The product decision</small>
              <strong>Move the memory and coordination<br />out of the human's head.</strong>
            </div>

            <div class="transfer-world">
              <div class="transfer-column transfer-human">
                <div class="transfer-head">
                  <span class="actor-dot"></span>
                  <div><small>HUMAN</small><strong>Meaning + judgment</strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="transfer-item human-intent">INTENT</div>
                <div class="transfer-item human-judgment">JUDGMENT</div>
              </div>

              <div class="transfer-arrow"><span></span><i>→</i></div>

              <div class="transfer-column transfer-product">
                <div class="transfer-head">
                  <span class="product-glyph">✦</span>
                  <div><small>PRODUCT</small><strong>Carry the workflow</strong></div>
                </div>
                <div class="product-stack">
                  <span class="product-context">CONTEXT</span>
                  <span class="product-state">STATE</span>
                  <span class="product-history">HISTORY</span>
                  <span class="product-work">WORK</span>
                  <span class="product-evidence">EVIDENCE</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="transfer-question">
                <small>only unresolved meaning crosses back</small>
                <span>What do <strong>you</strong> want?</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="problem-outro reveal">
      <p>
        That is usually how I work: I follow the friction until I can describe the burden
        <strong>the user should never have been carrying in the first place.</strong>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-story {
    --story-accent: #d8bd6f;
    --story-green: #aee0bd;
    --story-blue: #9fc7ff;
  }

  .problem-intro { max-width: 62rem; }

  .problem-story-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .86fr) minmax(520px, 1.14fr);
    gap: clamp(52px, 7vw, 116px);
    align-items: start;
    margin-top: clamp(56px, 8vw, 104px);
  }

  .problem-step {
    min-height: 74vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    max-width: 35rem;
    opacity: .24;
    transform: translateY(18px);
    transition: opacity .48s ease, transform .56s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1);
  }

  .problem-step.is-active { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

  .problem-step-label {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: .78rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .problem-step h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.62rem, 2.4vw, 2.35rem);
    line-height: 1.08;
    letter-spacing: -.035em;
    font-weight: 620;
  }

  .problem-step-lead { color: var(--ink) !important; font-size: 1.08rem !important; }

  .problem-step p:not(.problem-step-label) {
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.68;
  }

  .problem-stage {
    position: sticky;
    top: clamp(92px, 12vh, 132px);
    height: min(72vh, 700px);
    min-height: 580px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 32px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 78% 15%, rgba(216,189,111,.075), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,.025), transparent),
      var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.45) inset, 0 28px 70px rgba(14,14,14,.07);
  }

  .stage-chrome {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 20;
    inset: 0 0 auto 0;
    height: 56px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 22px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 88%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
  }

  .stage-kicker { color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .055em; }

  .stage-progress { display: flex; gap: 7px; }
  .stage-progress i {
    width: 18px; height: 2px; border-radius: 99px; background: var(--line);
    transition: width .35s ease, background .35s ease;
  }

  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] [data-progress-dot="0"],
  .problem-stage[data-state="1"] [data-progress-dot="1"],
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] [data-progress-dot="2"],
  .problem-stage[data-state="3"] [data-progress-dot="3"] {
    width: 30px; background: var(--ink);
  }

  .scene {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 56px 0 0;
    padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 44px);
    opacity: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    transform: translateY(24px) scale(.985);
    transition: opacity .45s ease, transform .65s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1);
  }

  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .scene-burden,
  .problem-stage[data-state="1"] .scene-ibiza,
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .scene-trust,
  .problem-stage[data-state="3"] .scene-transfer {
    opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }

  .scene-title small {
    display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem;
    letter-spacing: .055em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .scene-title strong {
    display: block; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.7vw, 1.5rem); line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -.028em; font-weight: 620;
  }

  /* 0 — human carries state */
  .burden-world { position: absolute; inset: 30% 7% 7%; }
  .actor { position: absolute; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
  .actor strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .actor small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .65rem; }
  .actor-human { left: 14%; top: 43%; }
  .actor-ai { right: 12%; top: 43%; align-items: flex-end; text-align: right; }

  .actor-dot {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; margin-bottom: 7px; display: block;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--ink) 23%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50%; background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 9px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.05);
  }

  .actor-spark {
    width: 40px; height: 40px; margin-bottom: 7px; display: grid; place-items: center;
    border-radius: 13px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 17%, var(--surface));
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 82%, var(--ink));
  }

  .burden-chip {
    position: absolute; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink);
    font-size: .6rem; font-weight: 650; letter-spacing: .055em;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.055); opacity: 0;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-chip {
    animation: burdenArrive .58s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1) forwards;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-file { left: 0; top: 5%; animation-delay: .12s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-decision { left: 33%; top: 12%; animation-delay: .28s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-agent { left: 2%; top: 72%; animation-delay: .44s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-version { left: 35%; top: 85%; animation-delay: .60s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-answer { left: 33%; top: 44%; animation-delay: .76s; }
  @keyframes burdenArrive {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px) scale(.93); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0) scale(1); }
  }

  .burden-count {
    position: absolute; left: 14%; top: 67%; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 7px; opacity: 0;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="0"] .burden-count { animation: fadeUp .5s ease 1.05s forwards; }
  .burden-count span { color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.45rem; font-weight: 650; }
  .burden-count small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .62rem; }

  /* 1 — Ibiza */
  .conversation-scene { position: absolute; inset: 29% 8% 7%; }
  .time-label {
    position: absolute; color: var(--faint); font-size: .58rem;
    font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .12em;
  }
  .time-earlier { left: 1%; top: 2%; }
  .time-later { right: 3%; top: 37%; }

  .chat-bubble {
    position: absolute; max-width: 245px; padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 18px; background: var(--surface);
    box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(0,0,0,.055);
  }
  .chat-bubble span { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .55rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .09em; }
  .chat-bubble p { margin: 5px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: .78rem; line-height: 1.38; }
  .chat-bubble em { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .59rem; font-style: normal; }
  .chat-user { left: 0; top: 10%; }

  .memory-card {
    position: absolute; left: 35%; top: 10%; width: 132px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 11px 12px; border-radius: 15px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 15%, var(--surface));
    opacity: 0; transform: scale(.92);
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="1"] .memory-card {
    animation: memoryLand .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1) .34s forwards;
  }
  @keyframes memoryLand { to { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); } }
  .memory-card small { display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .52rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .memory-card strong { display: block; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--ink); font-size: .74rem; }
  .memory-check { color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 76%, var(--ink)); }

  .chat-wrong { right: 0; top: 46%; opacity: 0; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="1"] .chat-wrong { animation: wrongQuestion 1.8s ease .76s forwards; }
  @keyframes wrongQuestion {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(12px); }
    28%, 64% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    100% { opacity: .34; transform: translateY(0); text-decoration: line-through; }
  }

  .chat-right {
    right: 0; top: 73%; opacity: 0;
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 38%, var(--line));
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="1"] .chat-right {
    animation: fadeUp .55s cubic-bezier(.2,.82,.2,1) 2.25s forwards;
  }

  .memory-link { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none; }
  .memory-link-path {
    fill: none; stroke: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 55%, var(--line));
    stroke-width: 1.2; stroke-dasharray: 290; stroke-dashoffset: 290;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="1"] .memory-link-path { animation: drawLine .9s ease 1.05s forwards; }
  @keyframes drawLine { to { stroke-dashoffset: 0; } }

  /* 2 — trust gate */
  .trust-pipeline { position: absolute; inset: 29% 10% 6%; }
  .incoming-question {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 0; transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; padding: 10px 14px;
    border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: var(--surface);
  }
  .incoming-question span {
    width: 22px; height: 22px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 18%, var(--surface)); font-size: .68rem;
  }
  .incoming-question strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: .67rem; }

  .pipeline-line {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--line), var(--story-accent), var(--line));
    transform-origin: top; transform: scaleY(0);
  }
  .pipeline-line-a { top: 46px; height: 39px; }
  .pipeline-line-b { top: 205px; height: 39px; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .pipeline-line-a { animation: lineGrow .42s ease .18s forwards; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .pipeline-line-b { animation: lineGrow .42s ease 1.65s forwards; }
  @keyframes lineGrow { to { transform: scaleY(1); } }

  .context-checks {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 84px; width: min(390px, 94%);
    transform: translateX(-50%); display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); gap: 7px;
  }
  .context-source {
    min-width: 0; padding: 10px 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--surface); text-align: center; opacity: .23; transform: translateY(8px);
  }
  .context-source span {
    display: block; overflow: hidden; color: var(--muted); font-size: .46rem;
    font-weight: 700; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .context-source i {
    display: grid; width: 17px; height: 17px; margin: 7px auto 0; place-items: center;
    border-radius: 50%; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 17%, var(--surface));
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 72%, var(--ink)); font-size: .55rem; font-style: normal; opacity: 0;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .context-source { animation: contextCheck .4s ease forwards; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-1 { animation-delay: .52s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-2 { animation-delay: .72s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-3 { animation-delay: .92s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-4 { animation-delay: 1.12s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-5 { animation-delay: 1.32s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .context-source i { animation: checkAppear .3s ease forwards; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-1 i { animation-delay: .67s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-2 i { animation-delay: .87s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-3 i { animation-delay: 1.07s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-4 i { animation-delay: 1.27s; }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .source-5 i { animation-delay: 1.47s; }
  @keyframes contextCheck { to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }
  @keyframes checkAppear { to { opacity: 1; } }

  .resolution-gate {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; top: 244px; width: min(390px, 94%);
    transform: translateX(-50%); opacity: 0;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .resolution-gate { animation: fadeUp .48s ease 1.92s forwards; }
  .resolution-gate > small {
    display: block; color: var(--muted); font-size: .52rem; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: .08em; text-align: center;
  }
  .resolution-paths { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 9px; margin-top: 10px; }
  .resolution-paths > div { padding: 10px 11px; border-radius: 12px; }
  .resolution-paths span, .resolution-paths strong { display: block; }
  .resolution-paths span { font-size: .48rem; font-weight: 750; letter-spacing: .09em; }
  .resolution-paths strong { margin-top: 3px; font-size: .62rem; font-weight: 580; }
  .resolution-system {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 12%, var(--surface));
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-green) 65%, var(--ink));
  }
  .resolution-human {
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 13%, var(--surface)); color: var(--ink);
  }

  .human-required {
    position: absolute; left: 50%; bottom: 0; transform: translateX(-50%) translateY(8px);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center; opacity: 0;
  }
  .problem-stage[data-state="2"] .human-required { animation: fadeUp .48s ease 2.35s forwards; }
  .human-required .actor-dot { width: 32px; height: 32px; margin-bottom: 5px; }
  .human-required strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: .63rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .human-required small { max-width: 190px; margin-top: 3px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .54rem; }

  /* 3 — responsibility transfer */
  .transfer-world {
    position: absolute; inset: 31% 8% 7%; display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 54px 1.18fr; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
  }
  .transfer-column {
    min-height: 260px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 21px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface) 92%, transparent);
  }
  .transfer-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .transfer-head .actor-dot { width: 30px; height: 30px; margin: 0; flex: none; }
  .product-glyph {
    width: 30px; height: 30px; flex: none; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 10px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 17%, var(--surface));
    color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--story-accent) 82%, var(--ink));
  }
  .transfer-head small, .transfer-head strong { display: block; }
  .transfer-head small { color: var(--muted); font-size: .5rem; letter-spacing: .08em; }
